Security/no-claim proof for WP12 category/risk taxonomy.

Contract negative paths:
- Category candidates require evidence refs.
- Confidence must parse through AppGameConfidenceSchema (0..1).
- Unknown VPN-like executable names remain nameHeuristicCandidate risk rows, not known identity facts.
- Parent display override requires rawIdentityChanged=false.
- AI source rows require aiDigestRef and stay review-only.
- policyCandidateAction excludes block, suspend, shield, hide, terminate, and launch actions.
- enforcementState has only notEnforcement.

No-claim boundaries:
- Category/risk rows are not identity proof.
- Category/risk rows are not content proof.
- Category/risk rows are not adapter authority.
- AI category output cannot directly enforce.
- No private executable path or command-line field was added to the taxonomy contract.
